"><div class="text-align-center align-center"><div class="margin-bottom"><p data-wf--tag--variant="base" class="chip_lab text">what we do</p></div><div class="heading-style-h2 margin-bottom max-500 text-align-center">Digital assets are table stakes for modern trading platforms.</div><div class="text-size-medium max-width-medium max margin-bottom text-align-center">Today’s investors expect access to digital assets alongside stocks, ETFs, and other products. For brokerages, not offering crypto is a competitive disadvantage. The challenge is launching quickly without creating a separate product, tech stack, or compliance burden that slows everything else down.</div><a data-wf--buttom--variant="light" class="cta-main w-variant-9d60eeed-1b36-e57d-bff0-754fc4db9657 ripple w-inline-block" data-wf-event-ids="" href="/contact" data-modal-open="" hero-animate="" ripple-effect="" data-livestream="" arrow-hover=""><div class="button-text-mask w-variant-9d60eeed-1b36-e57d-bff0-754fc4db9657"><div class="text_buttom w-variant-9d60eeed-1b36-e57d-bff0-754fc4db9657 _2-2">GET a demo</div></div></a></div></div></section></div><section class="section_casestudies padding-section-large"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="row_tow margin-bottom huge"><h2 class="heading-style-h2 max-450">Speed to market without added complexity</h2><div class="text-size-medium">zerohash helps brokerages add digital asset capabilities without increasing technical or operational complexity.</div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="card_box_grid _2 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="card_gray"><div class="card_item_text_space"><img alt="Buy / Sell" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69695a9f82e5911347c054cd_lightning%2C%20zap%2C%20flash.svg" loading="lazy" class="icon_regular big"/><div><h3 class="heading-style-h4 max-width-medium">Launch crypto trading faster</h3></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="card_gray"><div class="card_item_text_space"><img alt="Buy / Sell" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69695b5051eea52d8ed025dc_sparkles-soft.svg" loading="lazy" class="icon_regular big"/><div><h3 class="heading-style-h4 max-width-medium">Keep digital assets integrated into the core product experience</h3></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="card_gray"><div class="card_item_text_space"><img alt="Buy / Sell" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/696975ad1f9a980952d2f794_eye%20off%2C%20see%2C%20look%2C%20not%20visible.svg" loading="lazy" class="icon_regular big"/><div><h3 class="heading-style-h4 max-width-medium">Avoid managing custody, compliance, and settlement in-house</h3></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="card_gray"><div class="card_item_text_space"><img alt="Buy / Sell" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/696975ea08680858dea5a788_date-yearly%2Cfireworks%2Cnew-year.svg" loading="lazy" class="icon_regular big"/><div><h3 class="heading-style-h4 max-width-medium">Scale offerings without increasing operational overhead.</h3></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_how_works"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="w-layout-grid grid_item_one"><div class="div_left"><div class="margin-bottom"><p data-wf--tag--variant="green" class="chip_lab text w-variant-7ac8ff35-9437-c36e-e2cb-db3d1470a332">what we do</p></div><div class="heading-style-h2 text-color-withe max-500 margin-bottom">One platform for trading, movement, and expansion.</div><div class="text-size-medium text-color-withe max-400 margin-bottom">zerohash provides a single system that supports the full digital asset lifecycle.</div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="col-16 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="collection-i