</svg></div></div></div></div><div class="card_item_green gray"><div class="card_item_flex"><div><h3 class="heading-style-h4 margin-bottom margin-small">Staking</h3><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Enable compliant staking directly inside your platform. Meet growing demand for digital asset yield without managing validators, infrastructure, or staking operations.</div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_casestudies"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="w-layout-grid title-row zh-cs-head"><div class="flex zh-cs-copy"><div class="margin-bottom"><p data-wf--tag--variant="base" class="chip_lab text">Case Studies</p></div><div class="heading-style-h2 max-500">Real Platforms.<br/>Real Users. Real Scale.</div></div><div class="row-2x-small zh-ind-nav"><div class="blog_button-prev"><div ripple-effect="" class="icon-buttons zh-slider-nav"><div class="icon-medium text-color-drak big w-embed"><svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 20 20' width='18' height='18'><path stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.15' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M15.5 10H4.5M4.5 10L8.5 6M4.5 10L8.5 14'></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="blog_button-next"><div ripple-effect="" class="icon-buttons zh-slider-nav"><div class="icon-medium text-color-drak big w-embed"><svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 20 20' width='18' height='18'><path stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.15' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M4.5 10H15.5M15.5 10L11.5 6M15.5 10L11.5 14'></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div class="blog_slider zh-cs-view w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="logo_slider-wrapper swiper-wrapper zh-cs-track w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide zh-cs-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="testimonial_card zh-cs-figma"><div class="zh-cs-logo-panel"><img alt="Erik Schluter" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/6a8da9bfcbe653d892f95427_lassdog-brand.png" class="tesimonial_image zh-cs-logo"/></div><div class="testimonial_text zh-cs-copy"><div class="div-block-19"><div class="button-group"><p class="chip_lab margin-bottom margin-small grey">Lossdog</p></div><p class="text-size-regular zh-cs-body">&quot;We were looking for a launch reward substantial enough to matter and simple enough to execute fast. As a startup, that meant finding a turnkey solution rather than building compliance and custody infrastructure in-house. zerohash delivered on both counts, and the engagement numbers coming out of that first cohort exceeded what we projected.&quot;</p></div><div class="flex-b left"><div class="flex-small center small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/6a8da9a29788bb8f7c0c304a_image%205.png" alt="" class="icon_arrow ruonder"/><div><div class="text-weight-bold">Tom Sosnoff</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-gery">Chief Executive Officer</div></div></div><a aria-label="Read Lossdog case study" href="/case-studies/lossdog" class="zh-cs-cta w-inline-block"><div class="zh-cs-cta-pill">READ CASE STUDY</div><div class="zh-cs-cta-icon"><div class="w-embed w-script"><script type="eb77ae47049bfeb333139241-text/javascript"> (function(){ if(window.__zhCsLinkFix) return; window.__zhCsLinkFix=1; var map={ 'tom-sosnoff':'/case-studies/lossdog', 'manuel-godoy':'/case-studies/felix-pago', 'job-van-der-voort':'/case-studies/remote', 'joel-ippoliti':'/case-studies/republic', 'john-wang':'/case-studies/kalshi', 'john-tullis':'/case-studies/gusto', 'thomas-peterffy':'/case-studies/interactive-brokers-transact', 'anam-lakhani':'/case-studies/alinea-invest', 'stephen-sikes':'/case-studies/public', 'steve-sanders':'/case-studies/interactive-brokers-trading', 'milan-galik':'/case-studies/interactive-brokers-trading', 'fliex':'/case-studies/felix-pago', 'moneylion':'/case-studies/moneylion-2', 'kalshi':'/case-studies/kalshi' }; function fix(){ var links=document.querySelectorAll('a.zh-cs-cta'); for(var i=0;i<links.length;i++){ var a=links[i]; var href=a.getAttribute('href')||''; var parts=href.split('/').filter(function(p){return p}); var slug=parts.length?parts[parts.length-1]:''; var next=map[slug]; if(!next) continue; if(a.getAttribute('href')!==next) a.setAttribute('href', next); var slide=a.closest('.zh-cs-slide'); var chip=slide&&slide.querySelector('.chip_lab'); var name=chip?chip.textContent.trim():''; if(name) a.setAttribute('aria-label','Read '+name+' case study'); } } function boot(){ fix(); var lists=document.querySelectorAll('.zh-cs-view'); for(var i=0;i<lists.length;i++){ if(lists[i].__zhCsObs) continue; lists[i].__zhCsObs=1; new MutationObserver(fix).observe(lists[i],{childList:true,subtree:true}); } } if(document.readyState==='loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', boot); else boot(); })(); </script> <style id='zh-cs-cta-hover'>.testimonial_card.zh-cs-figma .zh-cs-cta{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:none}.zh-cs-cta{gap:0!important;column-gap:0!important}.zh-cs-cta-pill{position:relative;z-index:2}.zh-cs-cta-icon{position:relative;z-index:1;width:3.25rem!important;min-width:3.25rem!important;max-width:3.25rem!important;height:3.25rem!important;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;margin-left:-3.25rem!important;transform:scale(.8);transform-origin:left center;pointer-events:none;transition:margin-left .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),opacity .4s ease,transform .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)!important}.zh-cs-cta:hover .zh-cs-cta-icon,.zh-cs-cta:focus-visible .zh-cs-cta-icon{opacity:1;margin-left:0!important;transform:scale(1)}@media (hover:none){.zh-cs-cta-icon{opacity:1;margin-left:0!important;transform:none}}.zh-cs-cta-icon .w-embed{display:flex;width:1.15rem;height:1.15rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.zh-cs-cta-icon svg.zh-cs-arrow{display:block;width:1.15rem;height:1.15rem}</style><svg class='zh-cs-arrow' viewBox='0 0 27 27' fill='none' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M19.6625 16.3861V6.55469H9.83107' stroke='#111111' stroke-width='1.83521' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M6.8276 19.3916L18.5707 7.64844' stroke='#111111' stroke-width='1.83521' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide zh-cs-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="testimonial_card zh-cs-figma"><div class="zh-cs-logo-panel"><img alt="Erik Schluter" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce940fd58b3c6d06140ac1_felix.svg" class="tesimonial_image zh-cs-logo"/></div><div class="testimonial_text zh-cs-copy"><div class="div-block-19"><div class="button-group"><p class="chip_lab margin-bottom margin-small grey">Félix Pago</p></div><p class="text-size-regular zh-cs-body">“Users aren’t interested in how the money crosses borders. They simply want their money quickly, affordable, and reliably in their local currency.” </p></div><div class="flex-b left"><div class="flex-small center small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce9409a5ddfe90a4135b10_Manuel%20Godoy.png" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 1175px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce9409a5ddfe90a4135b10_Manuel%20Godoy-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce9409a5ddfe90a4135b10_Manuel%20Godoy.png 626w" class="icon_arrow ruonder"/><div><div class="text-weight-bold">Manuel Godoy</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-gery">Co-Founder and CEO</div></div></div><a aria-label="Read Lossdog case study" href="/case-studies/felix-pago" class="zh-cs-cta w-inline-block"><div class="zh-cs-cta-pill">READ CASE STUDY</div><div class="zh-cs-cta-icon"><div class="w-embed w-script"><script type="eb77ae47049bfeb333139241-text/javascript"> (function(){ if(window.__zhCsLinkFix) return; window.__zhCsLinkFix=1; var map={ 'tom-sosnof