inter-events:none;transition:margin-left .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),opacity .4s ease,transform .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)!important}.zh-cs-cta:hover .zh-cs-cta-icon,.zh-cs-cta:focus-visible .zh-cs-cta-icon{opacity:1;margin-left:0!important;transform:scale(1)}@media (hover:none){.zh-cs-cta-icon{opacity:1;margin-left:0!important;transform:none}}.zh-cs-cta-icon .w-embed{display:flex;width:1.15rem;height:1.15rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.zh-cs-cta-icon svg.zh-cs-arrow{display:block;width:1.15rem;height:1.15rem}</style><svg class='zh-cs-arrow' viewBox='0 0 27 27' fill='none' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M19.6625 16.3861V6.55469H9.83107' stroke='#111111' stroke-width='1.83521' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M6.8276 19.3916L18.5707 7.64844' stroke='#111111' stroke-width='1.83521' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide zh-cs-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="testimonial_card zh-cs-figma"><div class="zh-cs-logo-panel"><img alt="Erik Schluter" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69d2d22b0cb44d18ee80a0fa_Frank%20tamp.svg" class="tesimonial_image zh-cs-logo"/></div><div class="testimonial_text zh-cs-copy"><div class="div-block-19"><div class="button-group"><p class="chip_lab margin-bottom margin-small grey">Franklintempleton</p></div><p class="text-size-regular zh-cs-body">“We’re starting to see retail interest really ignite the demand for tokenized equities, for tokenized ETFs, for tokenized investment funds. What we expect is that we will see the institutions follow onto these new rails because it will be more efficient for them. They’ll be able to have less operational capital posted because you’re going to have immediate settlement of assets rather than having to fund the 24-hour or longer settlement cycle.” </p></div><div class="flex-b left"><div class="flex-small center small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69d2d22210671687d518429c_Sandy%20Kaul.png" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 1175px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69d2d22210671687d518429c_Sandy%20Kaul-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69d2d22210671687d518429c_Sandy%20Kaul.png 626w" class="icon_arrow ruonder"/><div><div class="text-weight-bold">Sandy Kaul</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-gery">Head of Innovation</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide zh-cs-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="testimonial_card zh-cs-figma"><div class="zh-cs-logo-panel"><img alt="Erik Schluter" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce9b1598ad39aeb3653842_BlackRock.svg" class="tesimonial_image zh-cs-logo"/></div><div class="testimonial_text zh-cs-copy"><div class="div-block-19"><div class="button-group"><p class="chip_lab margin-bottom margin-small grey">BlackRock</p></div><p class="text-size-regular zh-cs-body">“If we can tokenize an ETF, digitize that ETF, we can have investors who are just beginning to invest in markets, through, let’s say crypto. Now, we can get them into the more traditional long-term retirement products. We look at that as the next wave of opportunity for BlackRock over the next ten years.”
</p></div><div class="flex-b left"><div class="flex-small center small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce9b06a18c0e49838ca0a0_Larry%20Fink.png" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 1175px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce9b06a18c0e49838ca0a0_Larry%20Fink-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce9b06a18c0e49838ca0a0_Larry%20Fink.png 626w" class="icon_arrow ruonder"/><div><div class="text-weight-bold">Larry Fink</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-gery">CEO, BlackRock</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide zh-cs-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="testimonial_card zh-cs-figma"><div class="zh-cs-logo-panel"><img alt="Erik Schluter" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce9a1713262d9aba3e008c_draft%20king.svg" class="tesimonial_image zh-cs-logo"/></div><div class="testimonial_text zh-cs-copy"><div class="div-block-19"><div class="button-group"><p class="chip_lab margin-bottom margin-small grey">Draft King</p></div><p class="text-size-regular zh-cs-body">“[Stablecoins] are something we’re really focused on at DraftKings. Most of our products are not during normal banking hours. They’re evenings and weekends. Ninety percent of our volume comes the 12 hours before an event; half of it live. And our customers aren’t funding an account on Monday to trade. They are opening the app on Sunday.” </p></div><div class="flex-b left"><div class="flex-small center small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce99e25396b1b468bdcb20_Jeanine%20Hightower.png" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 1175px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce99e25396b1b468bdcb20_Jeanine%20Hightower-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce99e25396b1b468bdcb20_Jeanine%20Hightower.png 626w" class="icon_arrow ruonder"/><div><div class="text-weight-bold">Jeanine Hightower</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-gery">SVP, GM, DraftKings Predictions </div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide zh-cs-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="testimonial_card zh-cs-figma"><div class="zh-cs-logo-panel"><img alt="Erik Schluter" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce99095b30c51b1895cf90_Remote.svg" class="tesimonial_image zh-cs-logo"/></div><div class="testimonial_text zh-cs-copy"><div class="div-block-19"><div class="button-group"><p class="chip_lab margin-bottom margin-small grey">Remote</p></div><p class="text-size-regular zh-cs-body">“One of the biggest hurdles when hiring international talent is providing fast, flexible, and reliable payments around the world. Stablecoins have been highly requested by our customers.”
</p></div><div class="flex-b left"><div class="flex-small center small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce98ff07c852dc14dd7798_Job%20van%20der%20Voort.png" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 1175px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce98ff07c852dc14dd7798_Job%20van%20der%20Voort-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce98ff07c852dc14dd7798_Job%20van%20der%20Voort.png 626w" class="icon_arrow ruonder"/><div><div class="text-weight-bold">Job van der Voort</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-gery">CEO &amp; Co-founder</div></div></div><a aria-label="Read Lossdog case study" href="/case-studies/remote" class="zh-cs-cta w-inline-block"><div class="zh-cs-cta-pill">READ CASE STUDY</div><div class="zh-cs-cta-icon"><div class="w-embed w-script"><script type="eb77ae47049bfeb333139241-text/javascript"> (function(){ if(window.__zhCsLinkFix) return; window.__zhCsLinkFix=1; var map={ 'tom-sosnoff':'/case-studies/lossdog', 'manuel-godoy':'/case-studies/felix-pago', 'job-van-der-voort':'/case-studies/remote', 'joel-ippoliti':'/case-studies/republic', 'john-wang':'/case-studies/kalshi', 'john-tullis':'/case-studies/gusto', 'thomas-peterffy':'/case-studies/interactive-brokers-transact', 'anam-lakhani':'/case-studies/alinea-invest', 'stephen-sikes':'/case-studies/public', 'steve-sanders':'/case-studies/interactive-brokers-trading', 'milan-galik':'/case-studies/interactive-brokers-trading', 'fliex':'/case-studies/felix-pago', 'moneylion':'/case-studies/moneylion-2', 'kalshi':'/case-studies/kalshi' }; function fix(){ var links=document.querySelectorAll('a.zh-cs-cta'); for(var i=0;i<links.length;i++){ var a=links[i]; var href=a.getAttribute('href')||''; var parts=href.split('/').filter(function(p){return p}); var slug=parts.length?parts[parts.length-1]:''; var next=map[slug]; if(!next) continue; if(a.getAttribute('href')!==next) a.setAttribute('href', next); var slide=a.closest('.zh-cs-slide'); var chip=slide&&slide.querySelector('.chip_lab'); var name=chip?chip.textContent.trim():''; if(name) a.setAttribute('aria-label','Read '+name+' case study'); } } function boot(){ fix(); var lists=document.querySelectorAll('.zh-cs-view'); for(var i=0;i<lists.length;i++){ if(lists[i].__zhCsObs) continue; lists[i].__zhCsObs=1; new MutationObserver(fix).observe(lists[i],{childList:true,subtree:true}); } } if(document.readyState==='loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', boot); else boot(); })(); </script> <style id='zh-cs-cta-hover'>.testimonial_card.zh-cs-figma .zh-cs-cta{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:none}.zh-cs-cta{gap:0!important;column-gap:0!important}.zh-cs-cta-pill{position:relative;z-index:2}.zh-cs-cta-icon{position:relative;z-index:1;width:3.25rem!important;min-width:3.25rem!important;max-width:3.25rem!important;height:3.25rem!important;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;margin-left:-3.25rem!important;transform:scale(.8);transform-origin:left center;pointer-events:none;transition:margin-left .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),opacity .4s ease,transform .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)!important}.zh-cs-cta:hover .zh-cs-cta-icon,.zh-cs-cta:focus-visible .zh-cs-cta-icon{opacity:1;margin-left:0!important;transform:scale(1)}@media (hover:none){.zh-cs-cta-icon{opacity:1;margin-left:0!important;transform:none}}.zh-cs-cta-icon .w-embed{display:flex;width:1.15rem;height:1.15rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.zh-cs-cta-icon svg.zh-cs-arrow{display:block;width:1.15rem;height:1.15rem}</style><svg class='zh-cs-arrow' viewBox='0 0 27 27' fill='none' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M19.6625 16.3861V6.55469H9.83107' stroke='#111111' stroke-width='1.83521' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M6.8276 19.3916L18.5707 7.64844' stroke='#111111' stroke-width='1.83521' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide zh-cs-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="testimonial_card zh-cs-figma"><div class="zh-cs-logo-panel"><img alt="Erik Schluter" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c59605946d2fed8ac8bccb/69ce97a65d8764fee5212aa7_republic.svg" class="tesimonial_image zh-cs-logo"/></div><div class="testimonial_text zh-cs-copy"><div class="div-block-19"><div class="button-group"><p class="chip_lab margin-bottom margin-small grey">Republic</p></div><p class="text-size-regular zh-cs-body">“With zerohash we can accept stablecoins as a form of payment from anywhere around the world and get settled in fiat.”
